{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117028","id":3349558188,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7HpjOs","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117028","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117028.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117028.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117028","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117028/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117028/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117028/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/378ca0e520e188b1e236030c4598cd6849085704","number":117028,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Don't use invalid holding event in event listener","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117021\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nWhen we try to add event in input map setting panel, if we released `ui_cancel` using `ESC`, it maybe cause crash.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/778cf54dabd8a9e25b698a87036ab8604183f303/editor/settings/event_listener_line_edit.cpp#L184-L188\r\n\r\nWhen released `ESC`, it will set back `hold_event` to `event_to_check` without null Pointer checking. When the `hold_event` is invalid, it will cause `event_to_check` crashed later.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/778cf54dabd8a9e25b698a87036ab8604183f303/editor/settings/event_listener_line_edit.cpp#L191\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nSo we should check whether `hold_event` is valid before setting.\r\n\r\nAfter checking validation, I cannot re-produce crash on my local ubuntu environment any more.\r\n\r\n[input-esc.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b6f8c7e-4036-4b20-94fa-f6611a3015c8)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-03T16:04:14Z","updated_at":"2026-04-23T07:42:49Z","closed_at":"2026-04